 for NexCare Plus employee-only coverage was not retrieved in the policy chunks. The user should contact HR or the benefits administrator to obtain the exact COBRA premium amount.\n\nIn summary, the user should:\n1. Confirm if they can use the remaining $500 in the FSA before the end of the plan year or if they can elect COBRA to continue using the funds.\n2. Contact HR for the specific COBRA premium amount for NexCare Plus employee-only coverage.\n\n---\n**Sources:**\n1. Nexarion Solutions Employee Handbook (1) \u2014 Section 14: Acknowledgment of Receipt\n2. Nexarion State Policy Addendum \u2014 1.1 PTO Accrual & Carryover - California Override\n3. Nexarion Solutions Employee Handbook (1) \u2014 35 days (280 hrs)\n4. Nexarion Solutions Employee Handbook (1) \u2014 6.3 Pay Adjustments & Merit Increases\n5. Nexarion 2025 Benefits Guide \u2014 Section 5: Benefits During Leaves of Absence\n\n---\n_Note: This response is for informational purposes only and does not constitute legal advice. Please consult with HR or a qualified professional for guidance on your specific situation._", "grounding_score": 0.5, "compliance_passed": false}
