A\n4. Nexarion State Policy Addendum \u2014 1.4 Pregnancy Disability Leave (PDL)\n5. Nexarion State Policy Addendum \u2014 1.1 PTO Accrual & Carryover - California Override", "grounding_score": 0.7, "compliance_passed": true}
{"entry_id": "c77137f1-3d8a-48f5-b850-7c7b95397a8a", "session_id": "17893c3d-512b-4c9a-91f5-90b152a24c2e", "user_id": "c2fecc92-8195-47a6-9913-78824671c53e", "timestamp": "2026-04-27T19:49:08.421495", "query": "Am I eligible for the professional development fund?", "route": "hr_in_scope", "escalated": false, "situation_facts": "", "chunks_used": [{"document_name": "Nexarion Solutions Employee Handbook (1)", "section_header": "7.7 Wellness Stipend & Professional Development", "chunk_index": 62}, {"document_name": "Nexarion Solutions Employee Handbook (1)", "section_header": "7.7 Wellness Stipend & Professional Development", "chunk_index": 63}, {"document_name": "Nexarion 2025 Benefits Guide", "section_header": "3.2 Investment Options", "chunk_index": 13}, {"document_name": "Nexarion Solutions Employee Handbook (1)", "section_header": "3.1 Pre-Employment Requirements", "chunk_index": 17}, {"document_name": "Nexarion Solutions Employee Handbook (1)", "section_header": "7.3 Life & Disability Insurance", "chunk_index": 56}], "final_answer": "To be eligible for the professional development fund, the user must review the eligibility criteria outlined in the policy chunk [1] Source: Nexarion Solutions Employee Handbook (1) \u2014 7.7 Wellness Stipend & Professional Development. They should ensure that their job-relevant activities align with the approved categories and obtain manager pre-approval via the PD Request Form in Workday before submitting any requests.\n\nAdditionally, the user should be aware of the repayment obligation if they voluntarily resign within 12 months of receiving development funding exceeding $1,000. The policy states that employees who voluntarily resign within this timeframe are subject to a prorated repayment obligation.\n\nThe user can submit their professional development fund request through the Workday system and track its status. They should also keep records of their expenses related to job-relevant activities for reimbursement purposes.\n\nNo further action is required at this time, as the user has been provided with the necessary information to determine their eligibility for the professional development fund.\n\n---\n**Sources:**\n1. Nexarion Solutions Employee Handbook (1) \u2014 7.7 Wellness Stipend & Professional Development\n2. Nexarion 2025 Benefits Guide \u2014 3.2 Investment Options\n3. Nexarion Solutions Employee Handbook (1) \u2014 3.1 Pre-Employment Requirements\n4. Nexarion Solutions Employee Handbook (1) \u2014 7.3 Life & Disability Insurance", "grounding_score": 0.7, "compliance_passed": true}
